    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89164" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεπι-βάλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw upon besides</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς
				γῆς</span>
			<i>throw</i> some <i>more</i> earth upon, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.38.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.489
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>impose further burdens</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλείω π. οἷς ἂν ἐξ ἀρχῆς
					διανοηθῶσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					6.39
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπερι-</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				5.1.20
			</span></i>.</div>
